cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ACC-Optimization"
type: software
version: "2.1.0-telo"
license: "GPL-3.0-only"
abstract: >-
  Research software for reproducible adaptive cruise control gain optimization.
  Framework V2.1 constructs a frozen scalar ACC performance criterion from
  cruise set-speed RMSE, car-following CTG spacing RMSE, and realized jerk RMS
  using a MOPSO Pareto reference front and Sahib-Ahmed contribution weighting.
  The frozen criterion is then used to benchmark GA, DE, FVRADE, RNEGDE,
  Neighborhood-SHADE, and fixed-population DE-NPS-FP across independent runs.
